flowchart LR
    A[Camera capture] --> B[Image-quality gate]
    B -->|Poor image| C[Request recapture]
    B -->|Usable image| D[Edge classifier]
    D --> E[Trust-aware decision policy]
    E -->|Uncertain| F[Human review / re-observe]
    E -->|Possible disease| G[Alert packet]
    E -->|Healthy class predicted| H[Record limited-confidence observation]
    G --> I[Direct LoRa link]
    I --> J[Farmer-side receiver]
    J --> K[Display + buzzer/LED]
    K --> L[User ACK]
    M[Environmental sensor] -. Context only until validated .-> E
    N[Event store + retry policy] <--> J
